# Third-party licenses

The `lotse` binary links the crates below (for `x86_64-unknown-linux-musl` and
`aarch64-unknown-linux-musl`, default features). Each license text is given once, with every
crate it covers; the copyright notices are those the crates ship. lotse itself is MIT OR
Apache-2.0 (`LICENSE-MIT`, `LICENSE-APACHE`).

